and Reporting**: Since a sole trader operates without a formal governance body, it's even more critical to maintain thorough records of all actions taken regarding the protection and handling of information. This documentation should be clear and accessible, reflecting adherence to any applicable rules or guidelines.\n\nFor precise advice tailored to your situation, consulting with a legal professional who specializes in the relevant jurisdiction and industry would be advisable. They can provide guidance based on the specific definitions and requirements of \"C9,\" \"B1,\" and \"paragraph 22\" within your context.",
